# Package F "Carmen": Detective Rourke hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(carmen), carmen_paid, carmen_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('carmen_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('carmen_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(carmen)') && HasItem('carmen_diary')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(carmen)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Five bodies in the west since the dome sealed. Same knife. My bosses call it gang trouble. I call it Carmen. The singer at the commerce bar, the one everybody thought was dead.
#
o_text: What do you need?
o_id: carmen_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: carmen_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: Proof. She keeps a diary in a trunk in her dressing room, she wears the key. Bring it. Four hundred from my own pocket. If she comes at you, you defend yourself.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(carmen)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Carmen. The diary. Watch her hands.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He reads three pages, closes it, and is quiet for a long time.) It's her.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 400 sat, as agreed.
o_id: carmen_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: carmen_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Four hundred. I'll take it upstairs. If upstairs buries it, I'll take it to the news terminal.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'carmen_diary', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 400)
effect: SetFlag('carmen_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Another body this morning. Third street, behind the pawnshop. (He doesn't look at you.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: No new bodies. First week since the dome sealed.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Lock your door tonight.
effect: EndConversation
